  },
  {
    "id": 1003004010100,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "みんなが好きな曲を教えてくれるから\r\n全部組み込みたくなったりもして……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300401/1003004010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004010110,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "みんなで作るんだね、ライブ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300401/1003004010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004010120,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あっ！　でもでも、\r\n今日会った人たちが全員じゃないんでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300401/1003004010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今日顔合わせしたのは、\r\nメインで動いてもらうところの人たちだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "実際には、彼らの指示で動くスタッフさんもいる",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "何倍……もしかしたら何十倍もの人が\r\nイルミネのライブを一緒に作ってくれるはずだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004010130,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "なんだか、集大成って感じ……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0454",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300401/1003004010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004010140,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "これまでのイベントだって、ライブだって、\r\n全部大切だったし、全力でやってきたつもりだけど",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300401/1003004010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004010150,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ワンマンができるって、ひとつの節目みたいな",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300401/1003004010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004010160,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ここまで来たぞー！　っていうか……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300401/1003004010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『もう』か『やっと』か、\r\n感じ方は人それぞれだろうけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──でも",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "とうとうここまで来たんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "全員に『最高のワンマンだった』って\r\n言わせてみせような",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004010170,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "もちろん！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300401/1003004010170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004010180,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ここまで来たよ、のお披露目でもあるけど……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300401/1003004010180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004010190,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "『今まで支えてくれてありがとう』って\r\n伝える場でもあると思うから──",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300401/1003004010190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003004010200,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ずっと応援してくれた人にも、\r\nこれからわたしたちを知ってくれる人にも",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
